# A parent-linked tree: every node holds its parent and its name, and a new
# tree is built for each pass.
a node has:
    name (text)
    parent (node)
    depth (whole number)
round = 0
while round < 20000:
    root = a node with name "root", parent nothing, depth 0
    current = root
    for each level in the numbers from 1 to 30:
        child = a node with name "level " + level, parent current, depth level
        current = child
    round = round + 1
show round, current's depth
